  ($g1024$pst_ex37_3$g1024$, $g1025$gap$g1025$, $g1026$advanced$g1026$, $g1027${"id":"pst_ex37_3","level":"advanced","group":37,"gord":37,"no":3,"groupTitle":"Чотири часи","instruction":"Put the verbs in brackets into the Past Simple, the Past Continuous, the Past Perfect or the Past Perfect Continuous Tense.","prompt":"When Victor ______ (to get) off the bus he ______ (to decide) to phone his mother but suddenly ______ (to realize) that he ______ (to forget) his mobile phone in the hotel room.","answers":["got · decided · realized · had forgotten"],"blanks":[["got"],["decided"],["realized","realised"],["had forgotten"]],"explanation":"Послідовні дії + раніше забув: Past Perfect."}$g1027$, 91, $g1028$past_mix$g1028$),
