  ($g1044$pst_ex37_7$g1044$, $g1045$gap$g1045$, $g1046$advanced$g1046$, $g1047${"id":"pst_ex37_7","level":"advanced","group":37,"gord":37,"no":7,"groupTitle":"Чотири часи","instruction":"Put the verbs in brackets into the Past Simple, the Past Continuous, the Past Perfect or the Past Perfect Continuous Tense.","prompt":"Phil ______ (to wait) for twenty-five minutes before Pamela ______ (to send) a telegram and ______ (to return) to the car.","answers":["had been waiting · sent · returned"],"blanks":[["had been waiting","waited"],["sent"],["returned"]],"explanation":"For 25 minutes before → had been waiting."}$g1047$, 95, $g1048$past_mix$g1048$),
  ($g1049$pst_ex37_8$g1049$, $g1050$gap$g1050$, $g1051$advanced$g1051$, $g1052${"id":"pst_ex37_8","level":"advanced","group":37,"gord":37,"no":8,"groupTitle":"Чотири часи","instruction":"Put the verbs in brackets into the Past Simple, the Past Continuous, the Past Perfect or the Past Perfect Continuous Tense.","prompt":"By the time Steve ______ (to reach) the airport, Andrew and Nora ______ (already to receive) their luggage and ______ (to have) coffee in a cafeteria outside.","answers":["reached · had already received · were having"],"blanks":[["reached"],["had already received","had received already"],["were having"]],"explanation":"By the time → Past Perfect; тривала дія → were having."}$g1052$, 96, $g1053$past_mix$g1053$),
  ($g1054$pst_ex37_9$g1054$, $g1055$gap$g1055$, $g1056$advanced$g1056$, $g1057${"id":"pst_ex37_9","level":"advanced","group":37,"gord":37,"no":9,"groupTitle":"Чотири часи","instruction":"Put the verbs in brackets into the Past Simple, the Past Continuous, the Past Perfect or the Past Perfect Continuous Tense.","prompt":"Linda ______ (to phone) her dentist yesterday because one of her teeth ______ (to ache) for weeks.","answers":["phoned · had been aching"],"blanks":[["phoned"],["had been aching","had ached"]],"explanation":"For weeks до моменту дзвінка → had been aching."}$g1057$, 97, $g1058$past_mix$g1058$),
  ($g1059$pst_ex37_10$g1059$, $g1060$gap$g1060$, $g1061$advanced$g1061$, $g1062${"id":"pst_ex37_10","level":"advanced","group":37,"gord":37,"no":10,"groupTitle":"Чотири часи","instruction":"Put the verbs in brackets into the Past Simple, the Past Continuous, the Past Perfect or the Past Perfect Continuous Tense.","prompt":"When Tony ______ (to arrive) at Tina's place yesterday, she ______ (to read) a detective story which she ______ (to buy) some days before.","answers":["arrived · was reading · had bought"],"blanks":[["arrived"],["was reading"],["had bought"]],"explanation":"Arrived — коротка; reading — фон; bought раніше."}$g1062$, 98, $g1063$past_mix$g1063$),
  ($g1064$pst_ex14_1$g1064$, $g1065$abcd$g1065$, $g1066$intermediate$g1066$, $g1067${"id":"pst_ex14_1","level":"intermediate","group":14,"gord":14,"no":1,"groupTitle":"Test","instruction":"Match the sentences to the explanations of the usage of the Past Simple or the Past Continuous Tense.","q":"1. «Henry went camping with his friends last weekend.» — Яке пояснення вживання часу підходить?","options":["A) Одна дія тривала в минулому, а інша її перервала","B) Дія тривала у певний час у минулому","C) Дія відбулась (і завершилась) у певний момент у минулому","D) Опис події, що є фоном основних подій у минулому"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Завершена дія в певний момент → Past Simple."}$g1067$, 0, $g1068$past_cont$g1068$),
  ($g1069$pst_ex14_2$g1069$, $g1070$abcd$g1070$, $g1071$intermediate$g1071$, $g1072${"id":"pst_ex14_2","level":"intermediate","group":14,"gord":14,"no":2,"groupTitle":"Test","instruction":"Match the sentences to the explanations of the usage of the Past Simple or the Past Continuous Tense.","q":"2. «Diana was sunbathing while the children were swimming in the sea.» — Яке пояснення вживання часу підходить?","options":["A) Дві або більше дій відбулись одна за одною послідовно та без великих інтервалів у часі","B) Присудком є дієслово, яке не вживається в Past Continuous","C) Дві або більше дій тривали одночасно в минулому","D) Дія відбулась (і завершилась) у певний момент у минулому"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Одночасні тривалі дії → Past Continuous."}$g1072$, 1, $g1073$past_cont$g1073$),
  ($g1074$pst_ex14_3$g1074$, $g1075$abcd$g1075$, $g1076$intermediate$g1076$, $g1077${"id":"pst_ex14_3","level":"intermediate","group":14,"gord":14,"no":3,"groupTitle":"Test","instruction":"Match the sentences to the explanations of the usage of the Past Simple or the Past Continuous Tense.","q":"3. «We wanted to make a surprise for you.» — Яке пояснення вживання часу підходить?","options":["A) Дія відбулась (і завершилась) у певний момент у минулому","B) Одна дія тривала в минулому, а інша її перервала","C) Присудком є дієслово, яке не вживається в Past Continuous","D) Дія тривала у певний час у минулому"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Дієслова стану (want) не вживаються в Continuous."}$g1077$, 2, $g1078$past_cont$g1078$),
  ($g1079$pst_ex14_4$g1079$, $g1080$abcd$g1080$, $g1081$intermediate$g1081$, $g1082${"id":"pst_ex14_4","level":"intermediate","group":14,"gord":14,"no":4,"groupTitle":"Test","instruction":"Match the sentences to the explanations of the usage of the Past Simple or the Past Continuous Tense.","q":"4. «It was snowing heavily and the wind was getting stronger.» — Яке пояснення вживання часу підходить?","options":["A) Дві або більше дій тривали одночасно в минулому","B) Дві або більше дій відбулись одна за одною послідовно та без великих інтервалів у часі","C) Опис події, що є фоном основних подій у минулому","D) Присудком є дієслово, яке не вживається в Past Continuous"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Фон оповіді → Past Continuous."}$g1082$, 3, $g1083$past_cont$g1083$),
